{"title": "Wooden Crate (regular)", "pageid": 6102, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Wooden_Crate_(regular)", "categories": ["Containers", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wooden_Crate_A_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Wooden_Crate_A_Faded.webp/300px-Wooden_Crate_A_Faded.webp, /w/images/8/84/Wooden_Crate_A_Faded.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wooden Crate (regular) image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Wooden_Crate_A_Faded.webp/300px-Wooden_Crate_A_Faded.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Wooden_Crate_A_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Wooden Crate</b> is a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Container\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Container\">Container</a> that can be picked up or thrown. Usually contains <a href=\"/wiki/Consumables\" title=\"Consumables\">Consumables</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Equipment\" title=\"Equipment\">Equipment</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous</a> items and other randomized common loot.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" wi